B.bJr=new A.qR("event-2","Jazz Night",null,95,"March 18",u.n9,"Starting at $95.00 - $250.00","5:00 PM - 9:00 PM","Experience an unforgettable evening of live jazz in an intimate cocktail lounge setting designed for music lovers and night owls alike. From smooth, soulful melodies to timeless standards and lively improvisations, our talented performers bring depth and energy to every set. Settle into a warm, candlelit atmosphere where the music feels close, personal, and alive.\n\nSip on expertly crafted cocktails made with premium spirits and fresh ingredients, thoughtfully curated to complement the rhythm of the night. Whether you're enjoying a classic Old Fashioned or discovering a new signature creation, each drink is designed to enhance the experience.\n\nWith plush seating, attentive service, and an upscale yet relaxed ambiance, this is more than a performance \u2014 it's a moment to unwind, connect, and savor the art of live jazz. Perfect for date nights, celebrations, or simply treating yourself to an evening of exceptional music and atmosphere.",u.aK,B.aLA)
